{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
    "title": "omem 证据复核技能规则",
    "summary": "该技能细化了固定证据核验的检查顺序、归属和图像推断边界、冲突处理及禁止操作，是 verifier 提示词的操作性补充。",
    "category": "workflow",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "verification_sequence",
        "title": "从确定性身份到语义支持",
        "body": "技能要求先复查精确引文或图像身份；确定性检查无效或存在歧义时，不得给出 `supported`。随后逐项比较主体、范围、时间、条件、否定、归属和预期强度。[[c1]] 这一顺序将“证据是否是所声称的材料”与“材料是否支持提案”拆开，防止定位错误被语言相似性掩盖。"
      },
      {
        "key": "provenance_conflict",
        "title": "来源归属、冲突与推断限制",
        "body": "复核需区分所有者承诺、转发言论、建议和未知说话者，并检查当前记忆中的矛盾与后续更正；遇到冲突应保留冲突，而不是因措辞更自信就选定一方。[[c2]] OCR 和图片描述在无法直接读取原图时只能视为推断，也不能从单个工具步骤成功推导整体成功，或把相关性写成因果。[[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "non_authorizing_output",
        "title": "只评估、不授权",
        "body": "技能最终只允许返回 `AssessmentBatch.v1` JSON，并再次禁止批准、应用、执行、发送消息或改变政策。[[c4]] 因而它是证据质量控制环节，而不是变更执行器。技能规则描述了预期行为，但没有包含自动检查这些行为的测试或运行记录，实际遵循程度仍需从宿主校验和任务结果确认。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "身份复查与语义比较顺序",
        "reason": "支持先验证引文或图像身份、再按多个语义维度审查，且歧义身份不得判为支持。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 6,
          "endLine": 9
        },
        "quote": "# Review omem evidence\n\n1. Recheck exact quote or image identity before semantic review. An invalid or ambiguous deterministic check cannot become `supported`.\n2. Compare subject, scope, time, conditions, negation, attribution, and intended strength between evidence and proposal."
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "归属与冲突保留规则",
        "reason": "支持区分不同言论来源，并结合当前记忆和后续更正保留冲突的要求。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 10,
          "endLine": 11
        },
        "quote": "3. Distinguish owner commitments from forwarded speech, suggestions, and statements by unknown actors.\n4. Check supplied current memories for contradictions and later corrections. Preserve conflicts rather than selecting by confidence of wording."
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "图像与因果推断限制",
        "reason": "支持将不可独立读取的 OCR 或图片描述视为推断，并禁止从步骤成功或相关性作过强结论。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 12,
          "endLine": 13
        },
        "quote": "5. Treat OCR and image descriptions as inferred unless the supplied image is independently readable.\n6. Do not infer overall success from a successful tool step or correlation from causation."
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "核验技能输出权限边界",
        "reason": "支持仅返回 AssessmentBatch.v1 且不得批准或执行任何变更的结论。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/verifier/1/skills/omem-evidence-review/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 14,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "7. Return AssessmentBatch.v1 JSON only. Never approve, apply, execute, message, or change policy."
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "“固定证据”的身份检查由宿主确定性完成，还是完全交由 verifier 模型判断？",
        "why": "技能要求先做精确引文或图像身份检查，但没有说明输入是否包含宿主计算的校验结果，也没有界定模型可复核的原始资产范围。",
        "nextStep": "明确宿主与模型的职责分工，并为引文偏移、资产缺失、OCR 不一致和歧义图片建立测试用例。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
